	(text "8-bit GPIO, EXPIO0..EXPIO7 (P0..P7), on the shared I2C bus (I2C_SDA / I2C_SCL, pull-ups are on the root sheet).\nVCCI and VCCP are both PP3V3, so I2C and the P-port levels are 3.3V. Check the datasheet for per-pin drive limits.\nADDR tied to GND gives 7-bit address 0x20 (tie to PP3V3 for 0x21). Existing I2C devices: ASM330LHH 0x6A/0x6B, INA238 0x40-0x4F,\nso there is no clash.\n~RESET is tied to PP3V3 (internal power-on reset only, no MCU reset line).\n~INT is open-drain, active low, pulled up by 10K: EXP_INT goes low when any input changes from its last-read state.\nP0..P4 read the switched-rail state nets (PP3V3_CAN_ST, PP3V3_K_ST, PP12V_K_ST, PP3V3_GNSS_ST, PP3V3_GNSS_BCKP_ST); P5..P7 are unconnected. EXP_INT goes to the Connect Kit header (S1J3 pad 27)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
